# Design canvases. The .dc.html artboards and canvas.json are the source and
# are worth keeping; the seeded page beside them is 2MB of editor payload
# regenerated by the design skill on every change.
design/*-*.html
!design/*.dc.html

# A global ignore on the author's machine carries `sample.*`, which silently
# swallowed src/tools/conditional-access/lib/sample.js — a real source file
# the island imports for its "load a sample" state. Every local build passed
# (the file was on disk) and CI failed on an unresolved import 20 seconds in.
# A repo rule outranks the global excludes file, so nothing under src/ can be
# ignored by a pattern the repo never asked for.
!src/**/sample.*
